The gun is a firearm the [[Org/Althane/The First House|First House]] kept at [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/RC3|RC3]], and the artifact [[People/Althane/The Broker|the Broker]] hired [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]] to recover. A shot from it once put a hole through the Broker's own body.

[[People/Althane/Karkov|Karkov]] calls it the House's best chance at ridding the sphere of outward influence forever. A shot from it leeches the divinity out of whoever it strikes, and the loss does not pass. The Weft took it from Karkov.
